# Congee

Last Updated 01.01.2026

Serves two people.

## Ingredients

* 1c rice
* 7c water (or w/ 1c chicken stock)
* 1in ginger, julienned
* 3 cloves garlic, sliced
* 3 shittake mushrooms
* 2lb chicken, chopped
* salt
* white pepper

### Toppings

* peanuts, chopped
* cilantro
* 2 scallions, diced
* 1tbsp soy sauce
* 1tbsp sesame oil
* zhacai[^1]

## Directions

1. Wash rice and add to Instant Pot
1. Add garlic, ginger, mushrooms, and chicken (in that order)
1. Add water
1. Set to "Porridge" and let cook and vent
1. Shred chicken and return to pot
1. Serve with a drizzle of soy sauce and sesame oil

